Z||000002||AusFiero||08-11-2001||11:24 AM||||No exact price yet Stage-2 I kinda have to work things out as I build them. But it will not be a front fascia replacement but rather the mix and match bolt/bond on items shown in the previous front view posts. Keeps everyone individual that way and some may not want nose scoops etc. But I know it will be available in about a month. I have a workshop now and if I want to pay the rent I have to keep making the products.<BR>    Well mind you the rent on the workshop is very cheap at about US$36 a week for a workshop the size of a 6 car garage, and has a mezanine level over half of it. Plus it is near Ponti-World and he also has the wharehouse next door to the one I rented. Starting to create a big Pontiac dealership over here if we keep taking the other workshops  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> HHMMM only have to kick out the wood worker and the electrical supplies people, the panel shop and mechanic can stay...LOL||||reg||1
